<title>MALAYSIA: New Straits Times requotes.</title>
<headline>New Straits Times requotes.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of publisher New Straits Times Press (M) Bhd (NSTP) requoted on Monday at 13.90, unchanged from its September 9 suspension price while cable concern FCW Holdings Bhd will resume trading on Thursday, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, Malaysian Resources Corp Bhd, which owns about 48 percent of NSTP stock, was not yet requoted on Monday, after closing at 8.50 ringgit on September 9.</p>
